abstract: >-
  A Python tool for generating spatially-correlated random
  perturbations for atmospheric emission fields, designed
  for ensemble data assimilation applications. Uses gamma
  distributions and Gaussian kernel smoothing to create
  perturbation fields with specified error magnitudes and
  spatial correlation lengths.
